Package: poistree
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Poisson Point Process Tree Models
Version: 0.5.8
Date: 2026-10-07
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Pulong",
    family = "Ma",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "plma@iastate.edu",
    comment = c("Personal email" = "mpulong@gmail.com")
    )
Maintainer: Pulong Ma <plma@iastate.edu>
Description: Bayesian Poisson process trees for intensity estimation on
    high-dimensional covariate space. The extensible unified interface
    separates the gating mechanism from the posterior sampler. Implemented
    models are the hard-gated Poisson process tree (PPT) and the soft-gated
    Poisson process tree (S-PPT), both with terminal-leaf intensities.
